Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4943150,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4943150","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4943150,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4943150","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4943150,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4943150","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T15:32:47Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5220110","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4943150-1847286114027642","game_id":"steam-4943150","kind":"announcement","title":"Kaperfahrt is part of Steam Next Fest","summary":"Steam Next Fest is on until October 26, and Kaperfahrt is part of it. The free demo is on the store page. You sail into a Caribbean with more than 200 captains who trade, scheme and fight on their own plans, whether you are watching or not. Hunt the pirates on the Blacklist, take the ships you beat and build your own fleet, and watch prices climb when a port runs dry. Bugs and feedback go through the Discord ticket system, the link is in the main menu. Every report lands on a public board, gets ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:50:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027642","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:53:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943150-1843481262703739","game_id":"steam-4943150","kind":"announcement","title":"The Kaperfahrt demo is live","summary":"The demo is out. You can download it right now from the Kaperfahrt store page and set sail in the Caribbean. This closes the playtest. Thank you to everyone who took part in the first wave, reported bugs and told me what worked and what did not. A lot of that went straight back into the build you are playing now. The demo is free, there is no NDA, and you can talk about anything you see. If something breaks or feels off, the Discord ticket system is the place. The link is in the main menu of the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T06:40:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943150-1842212951297398","game_id":"steam-4943150","kind":"announcement","title":"The first playtest wave goes out on Friday","summary":"The first build goes out on Friday, August 28, around 6 PM CEST. As mentioned when signups opened, players come in in small waves rather than all at once, so if you are not in the first group you have not been forgotten. The waves grow as the build earns it. What you get is an early work in progress version of the open Caribbean. 200 AI captains sail, trade and fight on their own, whether you join them or not. Expect rough edges, that is what a playtest is for. What we want to know is how the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T16:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297398","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943150-1840944183782304","game_id":"steam-4943150","kind":"announcement","title":"The Caribbean is open","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46261713/1d9ab0012f423988942d8660b80fafbc1d618c9e.jpg The store page for Kaperfahrt is live, and the playtest has started. The game that never got its successor Kleinod is a one person studio from Germany, and the idea behind it is simple. Some games from childhood never got the successor they deserved. Kaperfahrt is the first attempt at one, the answer to a pirate sandbox from 2004 that defined a genre and was then left alone for twenty years. It has been in the works for abo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T15:11:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4943150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4943150":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4943150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z"},"5220110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"